§§ `s 171ZU(4) the conditions (claimant)`

-- Field order of `s 171ZU(4) the claimant's case`:
--    1. (a) the claimant and M satisfy prescribed conditions as to caring or intending to care for the child
--    2. (b)(i) the claimant satisfies prescribed conditions as to relationship with the child
--    3. (b)(ii) the claimant satisfies prescribed conditions as to relationship with M
--    4. (c)(i) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to employment or self-employment
