--    6. (d) weeks of continuous employment ending with the prescribed week
--    7. (d) the prescribed length of continuous employment in weeks
--    8. (e) at the end of that prescribed week the claimant was entitled to be in that employment
--    9. (f) normal weekly earnings in pounds for the prescribed period ending with the prescribed week
--   10. (g) regulations so provide that the person continues in employed earner's employment until a prescribed time
