--   12. (h)(i) M became entitled, by reference to the birth of the child, to a maternity allowance
--   13. (h)(ii) M became entitled, by reference to the birth of the child, to statutory maternity pay
--   14. (i)(i) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to the reduction of the duration of the maternity allowance period
--   15. (i)(ii) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to the reduction of the duration of the maternity pay period
--   16. (j)(i) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks the claimant would be entitled to claim if the entitlement were fully exercised
--   17. (j)(ii) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks the claimant intends to claim
--   18. (j)(iii) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks in respect of which M intends to claim
--   19. (k) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the period or periods during which the claimant intends to claim
--   20. (l)(i) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) is given by such time as may be prescribed
--   21. (l)(ii) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) satisfies prescribed conditions as to form and content
--   22. (m) M consents to the extent of the claimant's intended claim
--   23. (n) it is the claimant's intention to care for the child during each week in respect of which the pay is paid to the claimant
