§§ `s 171ZU(5) to (16), the extent of entitlement and its conditions`

-- Fixture: a period of days, both ends counted.  1 January 2026 is a Thursday, so Sunday 4 January and Saturday 10 January 2026 follow.
GIVEN fromDay IS A DATE
      toDay IS A DATE
GIVETH A Period
`s 171ZU test period` MEANS Period WITH
    `the first day` IS fromDay
    `the last day` IS toDay

-- (7)(a) maternity allowance: "a week or part of a week falling before the time at which the mother takes action", the week being Sunday to Saturday (s 122(1)).
-- Allowance payable Thu 1 Jan to Sat 10 Jan 2026.  Before or on the first day: nothing falls before the action.
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 31 12 2025) EQUALS 0
-- Action Fri 2 Jan: Thu 1 Jan falls before it, in the part-week Sun 28 Dec to Sat 3 Jan: one week
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 2 1 2026) EQUALS 1
-- Action Sun 4 Jan: the days before it are 1 to 3 Jan, still the one part-week
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 4 1 2026) EQUALS 1
-- Action Mon 5 Jan: Sun 4 Jan falls before it, in the next week: two weeks
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS 2
-- Action after the allowance ended (Sun 11 Jan, or much later): the two weeks it covered
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 11 1 2026) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026)) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS 2
-- Allowance from Sun 4 Jan to Sat 17 Jan: action Sun 11 Jan leaves one whole week (4 to 10 Jan); Mon 12 Jan adds a part-week
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 4 1 2026) (Date 17 1 2026)) (Date 11 1 2026) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(a) the number of relevant weeks of maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 4 1 2026) (Date 17 1 2026)) (Date 12 1 2026) EQUALS 2

-- (7)(b) statutory maternity pay: "a week falling before the week in which the mother takes action", the week being seven days from the start of the maternity pay period (s 165(8)).
-- Period Thu 1 Jan to Wed 28 Jan 2026 is 28 days: four weeks.  Action on the first day, or earlier: none.
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(b) the number of relevant weeks of statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(b) the number of relevant weeks of statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 20 12 2025) EQUALS 0
-- Action on the last day of the first week (Wed 7 Jan): no whole week falls before the week of the action
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(b) the number of relevant weeks of statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 7 1 2026) EQUALS 0
-- Action on the first day of the second week (Thu 8 Jan): the first week falls before it
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(b) the number of relevant weeks of statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 8 1 2026) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(b) the number of relevant weeks of statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS 2
-- Action well after the period: no more than the four weeks the pay covered
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(7)(b) the number of relevant weeks of statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS 4

-- (6) the greatest number of weeks: the weeks of the period, reduced.  Fixture figures: maternity pay period 1 to 28 Jan 2026 (4 weeks), maternity allowance period 1 Jan to 4 Feb 2026 (35 days, 5 weeks).
-- No early return to work: reduced by the weeks to which the period was reduced under s 165(3A): 4 - 1 = 3; a part of a week counts as a week (1.5 counts as 2): 4 - 2 = 2; no reduction: 4
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) FALSE 0 0 0 1 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) FALSE 0 0 0 (3 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS JUST 2
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) FALSE 0 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST 4
-- Early return to work without the prescribed conditions: reduced by the relevant weeks, or by the prescribed number if that is more.  Relevant 2, prescribed 3: 4 - 3 = 1.  Relevant 3, prescribed 2: 4 - 3 = 1.  Relevant 4, prescribed 0: 0.
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) TRUE 2 3 0 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) TRUE 3 2 0 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) TRUE 4 0 0 1 EQUALS JUST 0
-- A reduction larger than the period leaves a negative figure; the text does not say what then: not covered
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) statutory maternity pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) TRUE 5 2 0 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Maternity allowance: the maternity allowance period is the base (5 weeks) and s 35(3A) is the reduction: 5 - 2 = 3; s 165(3A)'s figure is not used
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) FALSE 0 0 2 1 EQUALS JUST 3
-- Maternity allowance with an early return to work: relevant 1, prescribed 3: 5 - 3 = 2
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` `s 171ZU(6) maternity allowance` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026)) TRUE 1 3 2 1 EQUALS JUST 2

-- (11) no payment before the end of the mother's maternity pay period: the last day (Wed 28 Jan 2026) is within it; the day after is not barred here
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(11) a payment may be made to the mother` (Date 28 1 2026) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(11) a payment may be made to the mother` (Date 15 1 2026) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(11) a payment may be made to the mother` (Date 29 1 2026) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (16) not affected by a multiple birth: the same answer for one child or several
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(16) the entitlement after the birth of more than one child` (JUST TRUE) 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(16) the entitlement after the birth of more than one child` (JUST TRUE) 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(16) the entitlement after the birth of more than one child` (JUST FALSE) 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(16) the entitlement after the birth of more than one child` NOTHING 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- no child born: there is nothing for the subsection to say
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(16) the entitlement after the birth of more than one child` (JUST TRUE) 0 EQUALS NOTHING

-- (8) "a part of a week is to be treated as a week": 3 weeks exactly is 3, 3 weeks and a part is 4, none is 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` 3 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` (22 DIVIDED BY 7) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` (7 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 4
-- (9) two entitlements together may not exceed what one person could have: 10 + 15 within 25, 10 + 16 beyond it
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(9) the two entitlements together are within what is available to one person` 10 15 25 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(9) the two entitlements together are within what is available to one person` 10 16 25 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(9) the two entitlements together are within what is available to one person` 25 0 25 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (10) no payment after the end of the prescribed period: 2 Feb 2026 is after 1 Feb 2026; the last day itself and earlier days are not barred here
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(10) a payment may be made in respect of the child` (Date 2 2 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(10) a payment may be made in respect of the child` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(10) a payment may be made in respect of the child` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (13) every limb is needed: notice of intention, given by the prescribed time, in the prescribed form
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZU(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
