§§ `s 171ZV(4) the conditions (claimant B)`

-- Field order of `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case`:
--    1. (a) claimant B and Y satisfy prescribed conditions as to caring or intending to care for the child
--    2. (b)(i) claimant B satisfies prescribed conditions as to relationship with the child
--    3. (b)(ii) claimant B satisfies prescribed conditions as to relationship with Y
--    4. (c)(i) Y satisfies prescribed conditions as to employment or self-employment
--    5. (c)(ii) Y satisfies prescribed conditions as to having earnings of a prescribed amount for a prescribed period
--    6. (d) weeks of continuous employment ending with the prescribed week
--    7. (d) the prescribed length of continuous employment in weeks
--    8. (e) at the end of that prescribed week claimant B was entitled to be in that employment
--    9. (f) normal weekly earnings in pounds for the prescribed period ending with the prescribed week
--   10. (g) regulations so provide that the person continues in employed earner's employment until a prescribed time
--   11. (g) claimant B continues in employed earner's employment until a prescribed time
--   12. (h) Y became entitled to statutory adoption pay by reference to the placement for adoption of the child
--   13. (i) Y satisfies prescribed conditions as to the reduction of the duration of the adoption pay period
--   14. (j)(i) claimant B has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks claimant B would be entitled to claim if the entitlement were fully exercised
--   15. (j)(ii) claimant B has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks claimant B intends to claim
--   16. (j)(iii) claimant B has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks in respect of which Y intends to claim
--   17. (k) claimant B has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the period or periods during which claimant B intends to claim
--   18. (l)(i) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) is given by such time as may be prescribed
--   19. (l)(ii) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) satisfies prescribed conditions as to form and content
--   20. (m) Y consents to the extent of claimant B's intended claim
--   21. (n) it is claimant B's intention to care for the child during each week in respect of which the pay is paid to claimant B
--   22. (o) claimant B is absent from work during each week in respect of which the pay is paid to claimant B
--   23. (p) the person is an employee within the meaning of the Employment Rights Act 1996
--   24. (p) claimant B's absence from work during each such week is absence on shared parental leave
`s 171ZV(4) test base` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test base` 100 EQUALS TRUE
-- paragraph (a) not satisfied
`s 171ZV(4) test (a) fails` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test (a) fails` 100 EQUALS FALSE
-- paragraph (b) is satisfied by either limb
`s 171ZV(4) test (b)(i) alone fails` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test (b)(i) alone fails` 100 EQUALS TRUE
-- paragraph (b) is satisfied by either limb
`s 171ZV(4) test (b)(ii) alone fails` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test (b)(ii) alone fails` 100 EQUALS TRUE
-- paragraph (b) needs one limb
`s 171ZV(4) test (b) both limbs fail` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test (b) both limbs fail` 100 EQUALS FALSE
-- paragraph (c) needs every limb
`s 171ZV(4) test (c)(i) fails` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test (c)(i) fails` 100 EQUALS FALSE
-- paragraph (c) needs every limb
`s 171ZV(4) test (c)(ii) fails` MEANS `s 171ZV(4) the claimant B's case` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 52, 26, TRUE, 150, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(4) all the conditions are satisfied` `s 171ZV(4) test (c)(ii) fails` 100 EQUALS FALSE
-- one week short of the prescribed length
