§§ `s 171ZV(5) to (18), the extent of entitlement and its conditions`

-- (7) a relevant week is a week before the week of the action; the week is seven days from the start of the adoption pay period (s 171ZN(8)).
-- Period Thu 1 Jan to Wed 28 Jan 2026 is four weeks.
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(7) the number of relevant weeks of statutory adoption pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(7) the number of relevant weeks of statutory adoption pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 20 12 2025) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(7) the number of relevant weeks of statutory adoption pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 7 1 2026) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(7) the number of relevant weeks of statutory adoption pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 8 1 2026) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(7) the number of relevant weeks of statutory adoption pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(7) the number of relevant weeks of statutory adoption pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS 4

-- (6) the greatest number of weeks: the weeks of the adoption pay period (1 to 28 Jan 2026 is 4), reduced.
-- No early return to work: reduced by the weeks to which the period was reduced under s 171ZN(2A): 4 - 1 = 3; 1.5 counts as 2: 4 - 2 = 2; none: 4
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) FALSE 0 0 1 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) FALSE 0 0 (3 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS JUST 2
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) FALSE 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST 4
-- Early return to work without the prescribed conditions: relevant 2, prescribed 3: 4 - 3 = 1; relevant 3, prescribed 2: 4 - 3 = 1; relevant 4, prescribed 0: 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) TRUE 2 3 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) TRUE 3 2 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) TRUE 4 0 1 EQUALS JUST 0
-- a reduction larger than the period leaves a negative figure: not covered
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(6) the greatest number of weeks of statutory shared parental pay` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) TRUE 5 2 1 EQUALS NOTHING

-- (11) no payment before the end of the adoption pay period: the last day (Wed 28 Jan 2026) is within it; the day after is not barred here
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(11) a payment may be made to the person who became entitled to statutory adoption pay` (Date 28 1 2026) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(11) a payment may be made to the person who became entitled to statutory adoption pay` (Date 15 1 2026) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(11) a payment may be made to the person who became entitled to statutory adoption pay` (Date 29 1 2026) (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (16) not affected by the placement of more than one child as part of the same arrangement
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(16) the entitlement after the placement for adoption of more than one child` (JUST TRUE) 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(16) the entitlement after the placement for adoption of more than one child` (JUST TRUE) 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(16) the entitlement after the placement for adoption of more than one child` (JUST FALSE) 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(16) the entitlement after the placement for adoption of more than one child` NOTHING 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(16) the entitlement after the placement for adoption of more than one child` (JUST TRUE) 0 EQUALS NOTHING

-- (18) the reading rule: an ordinary placement for adoption is one; the two foster placements count only for regulations made by virtue of (17) and only with an approved foster parent
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed for adoption under the law of a part of the United Kingdom` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed under section 22C of the Children Act 1989` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed under section 81 of the Social Services and Well-being (Wales) Act 2014` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed under section 22C of the Children Act 1989` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed under section 22C of the Children Act 1989` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed under section 81 of the Social Services and Well-being (Wales) Act 2014` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(18) the placement counts as a placement for adoption` `placed under section 81 of the Social Services and Well-being (Wales) Act 2014` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (8) "a part of a week is to be treated as a week": 3 weeks exactly is 3, 3 weeks and a part is 4, none is 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` 3 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` (22 DIVIDED BY 7) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(8) the number of weeks counting a part of a week as a week` (7 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 4
-- (9) two entitlements together may not exceed what one person could have: 10 + 15 within 25, 10 + 16 beyond it
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(9) the two entitlements together are within what is available to one person` 10 15 25 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(9) the two entitlements together are within what is available to one person` 10 16 25 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(9) the two entitlements together are within what is available to one person` 25 0 25 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (10) no payment after the end of the prescribed period: 2 Feb 2026 is after 1 Feb 2026; the last day itself and earlier days are not barred here
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(10) a payment may be made in respect of the child` (Date 2 2 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(10) a payment may be made in respect of the child` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(10) a payment may be made in respect of the child` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (13) every limb is needed: notice of intention, given by the prescribed time, in the prescribed form
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(13) the conditions for varying the period or periods are satisfied` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- (12) regulations may provide that V may vary: no such regulations is not covered; with them, the (13) conditions decide
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(12) V may vary the period or periods` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(12) V may vary the period or periods` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(12) V may vary the period or periods` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(12) V may vary the period or periods` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (15) every limb is needed: the four notices, in time, in form, and the consent of the other person
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(15) the conditions for varying the number of weeks are satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- (14) as (12), with the (15) conditions
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(14) V may vary the number of weeks` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(14) V may vary the number of weeks` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(14) V may vary the number of weeks` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZV(14) V may vary the number of weeks` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 171ZW entitlement: general`

-- (1)(a) regulations may disapply a condition: disapplied is the text's "do not have effect"; modified or untouched is not covered
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(1)(a) the condition has effect in the case` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(1)(a) the condition has effect in the case` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(1)(a) the condition has effect in the case` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(1)(a) the condition has effect in the case` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) "include": the two named persons are covered, any other is not
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(2) requirements about evidence and procedure may be imposed on the person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(2) requirements about evidence and procedure may be imposed on the person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(2) requirements about evidence and procedure may be imposed on the person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(2) requirements about evidence and procedure may be imposed on the person` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) the prescribed period is the length prescribed under whichever of the four provisions applies (four different lengths, to catch a swap)
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(3) the prescribed period in weeks` `s 171ZW(3) section 171ZU(2)(c)` 11 22 33 44 EQUALS 11
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(3) the prescribed period in weeks` `s 171ZW(3) section 171ZU(4)(d)` 11 22 33 44 EQUALS 22
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(3) the prescribed period in weeks` `s 171ZW(3) section 171ZV(2)(c)` 11 22 33 44 EQUALS 33
#ASSERT `s 171ZW(3) the prescribed period in weeks` `s 171ZW(3) section 171ZV(4)(d)` 11 22 33 44 EQUALS 44

§§ `s 171ZX liability to make payments`

#ASSERT `s 171ZX(1) the person is liable to make payments of statutory shared parental pay` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not an employer in the s 171ZU(2)(c) sense: s 171ZX(3) lets regulations make the Commissioners liable, so not covered
#ASSERT `s 171ZX(1) the person is liable to make payments of statutory shared parental pay` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the duty as a regulative rule: the liable person pays 100 and the duty is FULFILLED (no time limit in the text)
#TRACE `s 171ZX(1) the duty to make the payments` 100 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 171ZX the person liable to make the payments` DOES `s 171ZX makes a payment of statutory shared parental pay` 100 AT 1

§§ `s 171ZY rate and period of pay`

#ASSERT `s 171ZY(1) the weekly rate of statutory shared parental pay in pounds` (JUST 100) EQUALS JUST 100
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(1) the weekly rate of statutory shared parental pay in pounds` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (7) a week in a notice's period counts, unless a variation afterwards excluded it
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(7) the week falls within a relevant period` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(7) the week falls within a relevant period` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(7) the week falls within a relevant period` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(7) the week falls within a relevant period` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (8) the weeks of a relevant period run seven days at a time from its first day: relevant period Thu 1 Jan to Wed 28 Jan 2026
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(8) the week of the relevant period containing the day` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 7 1 2026))
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(8) the week of the relevant period containing the day` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 7 1 2026) EQUALS JUST (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 7 1 2026))
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(8) the week of the relevant period containing the day` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 8 1 2026) EQUALS JUST (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 8 1 2026) (Date 14 1 2026))
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(8) the week of the relevant period containing the day` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 28 1 2026) EQUALS JUST (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 22 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026))
-- a day outside the relevant period is in none of its weeks
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(8) the week of the relevant period containing the day` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 31 12 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(8) the week of the relevant period containing the day` (`s 171ZU test period` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 28 1 2026)) (Date 29 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) payable for each week in a relevant period, up to the number of weeks determined: the 4th of 4 is payable, the 5th is outside the grant
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(2) statutory shared parental pay is payable for the week` (JUST TRUE) 3 4 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(2) statutory shared parental pay is payable for the week` (JUST TRUE) 4 4 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(2) statutory shared parental pay is payable for the week` (JUST TRUE) 5 4 EQUALS NOTHING
-- a week not in a relevant period, or one the text does not settle, is not covered by the grant
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(2) statutory shared parental pay is payable for the week` (JUST FALSE) 1 4 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(2) statutory shared parental pay is payable for the week` NOTHING 1 4 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) not payable for a week in a relevant period if the person does not intend, at its start, to care for the child
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(3) the pay is payable for the week despite the intention to care` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(3) the pay is payable for the week despite the intention to care` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- a week outside a relevant period is outside this bar
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(3) the pay is payable for the week despite the intention to care` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(3) the pay is payable for the week despite the intention to care` NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "Except in such cases as may be prescribed"
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(3) the pay is payable for the week despite the intention to care` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) not payable for a week in a relevant period during any part of which the person works for any employer
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(4) the pay is payable for the week despite work for an employer` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(4) the pay is payable for the week despite work for an employer` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(4) the pay is payable for the week despite work for an employer` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(4) the pay is payable for the week despite work for an employer` NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(4) the pay is payable for the week despite work for an employer` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6) one seventh of the weekly rate
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(6) the daily rate in pounds` 70 EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(6) the daily rate in pounds` 7 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `s 171ZY(6) the daily rate in pounds` 0 EQUALS 0

