#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(1) the entitlement affects the person's right to contractual remuneration` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(1) the entitlement affects the person's right to contractual remuneration` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2)(a) liability 300 less remuneration paid 100 leaves 200; paid 300 or more leaves nothing
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(2)(a) the liability to pay statutory shared parental pay that remains` 300 100 EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(2)(a) the liability to pay statutory shared parental pay that remains` 300 300 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(2)(a) the liability to pay statutory shared parental pay that remains` 300 400 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(2)(a) the liability to pay statutory shared parental pay that remains` 300 0 EQUALS 300
