#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(2)(b) the liability to pay contractual remuneration that remains` 500 500 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ1(2)(b) the liability to pay contractual remuneration that remains` 500 600 EQUALS 0

