#ASSERT `s 171ZZ2 the provisions of this Part apply to the person` `a company or other body corporate` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ2 the provisions of this Part apply to the person` `an individual` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
