#ASSERT `s 171ZZ2 the provisions of this Part apply to the person` `the Crown` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZZ2 the provisions of this Part apply to the person` `the Crown` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

